CHAPTER.VERS:
And I heard another voice from heaven, saying, Come forth, my people, out of her, that you

          {+}
         have no fellowship with her sins, and that you

          {+}
         do not receive of her plagues:

Rejoice over her, you heaven, and you

          {+}
         saints, and you

          {+}
         apostles, and you

          {+}
         prophets; for God has judged your

          {+}
         judgment on her.
